{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Knotgud disaster in this point and click deduction mystery. Explore the kingdom of Knotgud, interrogate townsfolk, and investigate with magical tools. Use your discoveries to piece the events together word by word in your scroll of truth to find out, Who Summoned It?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Knotgud needs you! A terrible creature has been summoned and torments the land! Thankfully Riki Rocktoe, the soft-boiled truthmeister, is on the case. But he's not alone,  accompany Riki as the possessed Scroll of Truth that only allows true statements to be written on it. Yes, you're a piece of parchment. A <i>magical</i> piece of parchment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/a9aff9e04f0ffff92140876f236c33d4.avif?t=1769451378\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 40 areas across town and time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the environment and scrutinize crime scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an entirely hand-drawn animated world with over an hour of original music by ZIppry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical tools to aid you. Look into the past with a cracked crystal ball, get into tiny spaces with all-purpose-rats. Smell the different colors of magic with an enchanted cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/3a981c8c74e24d11b0902428e0f0dbad.avif?t=1769451378\" width=97 height=97 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/359c4095498584e256694f2d47dcfcde.avif?t=1769451378\" width=100 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/1601969d6b65aa2efeabc5ed27e5ac55.avif?t=1769451378\" width=130 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/5bbb7e16c99b366f65c22d67aa04a4df.avif?t=1769451378\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of over twenty suspects with different motives and plots to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrutinize statements and compare stories to reach conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deeper and unlock more topics as the mystery unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/35e7afcb1b445be6ae4418da5a2faecc.avif?t=1769451378\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover  clues, phrases and use logical deduction to complete fill in the blank style mysteries.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take notes on your suspects and build a profile on everyone in town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various mysteries throughout Knotgud in non-linear progression.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/49802435e011a54d2523929b78803138.avif?t=1769451378\" width=181 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682850?t=1769451378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/82fc7ba647f5cc357c46330d36002a7e77b1d7fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769451378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/5717ecfc1e08a43ec1a630db1062780304d19731/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769451378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/5717ecfc1e08a43ec1a630db1062780304d19731/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769451378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the Knotgud disaster in this point and click deduction mystery. Explore the kingdom of Knotgud, interrogate townsfolk, and investigate with magical tools. Use your discoveries to piece the events together word by word in your scroll of truth to find out, Who Summoned It?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Knotgud needs you! A terrible creature has been summoned and torments the land! Thankfully Riki Rocktoe, the soft-boiled truthmeister, is on the case. But he's not alone,  accompany Riki as the possessed Scroll of Truth that only allows true statements to be written on it. Yes, you're a piece of parchment. A <i>magical</i> piece of parchment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682850/extras/a9aff9e04f0ffff92140876f236c33d4.avif?t=1769451378\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\